{"id":"truppe","lemma":"Truppe","pos":"noun","rank":1933,"glosses":["troupe (company of actors, etc.)","force","forces"],"ipa":"/ˈtʁʊpə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1c/De-Truppe.ogg/De-Truppe.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Truppe","plural":"Truppen"},"examples":[{"text":"Unsere Truppen besetzten die Stadt.","en":"Our forces occupied the city.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"to occupy","l":"besetzen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"city"}]},{"text":"Der General inspizierte die Truppe.","en":"The general inspected the troops.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"general"},null,{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Unsere Truppen griffen den Feind an.","en":"Our troops engaged with the enemy.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"to grab","l":"greifen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"enemy, fiend, foe"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Der Hauptmann behandelt seine Truppe gut.","en":"That captain handles his troops well.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"captain (male [also…"},{"g":"treated"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"good"}]},{"text":"Die Truppen rückten 20 Meilen vor.","en":"The troops advanced twenty miles.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"international mile","l":"Meile"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"}]}]}